The  device  driver  supports  DEC EtherWORKS III Ethernet inter‐
faces, which are based on the LEMAC Ethernet chip.  This includes
the DE203, DE204, and DE205.  The EtherWORKS III series  supports
various  combinations  of media, depending on model.  Some models
also support media autoselect.  Media is selected with directive.
The does not currently support EISA LEMAC interfaces.
